usage: python -m jev.server [-h] (--checkpoint CHECKPOINT | --model MODEL_ID)
                            [--revision REVISION] [--device DEVICE]
                            [--max-length MAX_LENGTH]
                            [--batch-size BATCH_SIZE]
                            [--prefix-cache | --no-prefix-cache] [--host HOST]
                            [--port PORT]

Local HTTP service for Open-Jev; no cloud keys or generated JSON required.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --checkpoint CHECKPOINT
  --model MODEL_ID
  --revision REVISION
  --device DEVICE
  --max-length MAX_LENGTH
  --batch-size BATCH_SIZE
  --prefix-cache, --no-prefix-cache
                        Enable request-local token-prefix reuse; default off
                        pending full-checkpoint BF16 validation
  --host HOST
  --port PORT
